WEBVTT

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:08.090
Saint Artemis' Correctional Center?

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:09.860
It sounds ominous.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:14.890
That's because it's a place both the ICP and Lunar Police databases don't have records of.

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:18.560
The part Leopard needs is in there, Honoka-chan?

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.120
That's right. But the whole place is heavily guarded.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.570
When they say "correctional center," what exactly are they correcting...?

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.410
Little girls who can't help but steal things.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.080
Imo-chan, I think it would be better if you stay here...

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.080
No way. I will protect Ojou-sama.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.540
Will this be all right?

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:37.920
It will.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:42.040
The defense of Imo-chan's Q-Tector is currently at its maximum.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.260
She is the safest out of all of us.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:47.880
Don't stray away from my side.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.050
Yes!

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.180
Let's hurry.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.850
Itsuki-chan, are you okay with this?

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:53.900
Someone from ICP doing this...

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.390
Even now, I'm still working.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:57.890
This is for my investigation.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:01.060
You'll keep your promise, right, Honoka?

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:04.410
If you assist in our mission, we'll let you meet Leopard.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.110
We definitely can't fail now, with Itsuki-chan's request.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.570
I have so much behind me.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.330
All right! Let's increase the tension and go!

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:14.840
All right. Shall we go?

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.000
Umm... Mr. Policeman, are you going as well?

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.920
You're going right?

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:23.750
Ul is a man among men. He will protect us.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:30.010
Hey, I'm only making sure you all don't stray off the path of righteousness.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:37.980
Flying through space, freely, gracefully

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:41.680
On the shoulders and in the heart, the girl has wings

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:45.370
The world she was born into is beautiful

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:49.020
Even a goddess cannot rule

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:56.430
That dream on a star born in darkness,

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:59.330
it won't shine by just watching.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:03.790
My body becomes a spaceship,

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:07.050
and climbs to the atmosphere of my thoughts

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:21.810
If I try to resign to calmness, my heart will bug up.

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:25.530
Hey, with your rocket,

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:28.970
can you change my path?

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:32.900
By being connected together, we confirm

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:38.440
we aren't androids

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:42.390
Across the rainbow, to the future to someone

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:46.110
If wishing will get me there, I will gradually start believing

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:49.770
The world we march into is limitless

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:53.440
Even God cannot destroy it all

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:58.580
And one day even the sins people made will disappear

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:11.750
Channel 008. Radio Leopard.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.160
Good evening everyone.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.080
It's time for Radio Leopard.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.750
This is Leopard's... The host is Leopard...

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.590
A special program from Leopard.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:23.760
Today, there are special guests together with me on this colony.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:24.840
White Black Belt

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:24.430
Good evening.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.220
Ah... Good evening.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:34.770
It's been half a day since Takane's last periodic transmission.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.560
We should assume that she's fallen into their hands now.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.020
It's finally begun, huh?

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:43.190
According to our surveillance around Saint Artemis' Correctional Center,

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:46.280
Leopard's transport ship has appeared nearby.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.870
Ah! Why are they...?

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.200
I can't imagine that they know about this incident.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.830
They might be there to collect parts like last time.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.290
She has such bad timing, really.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.380
Should we send in the rescue squad?

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.710
No. There isn't a need.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.960
Letting Emilio go to the Moon should be enough.

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.300
Eh? Are you sure?

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.430
Given the situation, we'll just have to match Akiha's actions.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:11.560
I'm going to the head family branch right now to exchange pleasantries.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.970
You're going to meet the Shishidou Elders?

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:16.100
We will need to take reactionary measures soon,

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.060
so the committee must be alerted.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.360
Understood.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.130
What was that place just now?

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.800
It seems to be a production factory.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.470
Where were you looking?

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.010
It's because you stopped so suddenly...

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:53.430
What's wrong?

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.140
Because Honoka-san...

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.200
By the way, which direction are we heading after here?

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:00.730
Honoka-chan, which way?

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.730
There.

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:07.070
There?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.150
Umm... is there a logical reason for that?

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:11.990
Maybe it's that way.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:12.660
Hey...

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:16.750
In short, you don't know which way it is...

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.330
At this rate, we wouldn't even know if we found what we were looking for here.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.210
Let's gather information first.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:27.920
I think the most effective method would be to hack into the mainframe system and obtain a blueprint of the building.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.340
That's the way, Theory.

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:31.140
Ojou-sama.

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.430
Imo-chan, is your Q-Tector okay?

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:34.470
Yes!

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:37.140
My whole body is as light as a feather.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:39.770
But this... This...

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.060
This?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:46.860
Oh! A whole new world has...

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:16.100
It's open.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:26.900
This is it.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:30.150
At the very bottom level, there is a secret facility in use.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:31.150
It's most likely that.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:36.410
But the door leading to it has a high level security lock.

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.080
Can you do it?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:40.500
Leave it to me. This should do it.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:48.050
Hey!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.640
Damn, I've done it now!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.430
Ul?

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.180
I shut down the entire facility's security system.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.930
It seems that they were all linked together.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:04.440
You're right.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.020
Let's go lower.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:15.530
Seriously... Be it Shishidou or Kannagi...

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:17.070
How dare they...

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:19.370
Min-chan, what are we going to do?

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.660
We let Kannagi Itsuki escape too.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:26.690
If we go back to the headquarters like this, our lives will just go "Fu~"

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:30.130
Calm down. There must be a way.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:30.880
Some other way...

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:35.760
Who's that?

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:36.890
It's us.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.100
Yes!

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:43.770
Were you surprised?

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.150
Did you let your guard down because it's a normal line?

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.060
We didn't let our guard down.

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:49.860
We are doing our best in chasing Kannagi down.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.690
Is that true?

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:55.110
Not contacting us for updates,

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.620
and it looks like you have nothing to say on the public line...

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:01.700
It's not like you're trying to hide from us, are you?

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.120
It definitely isn't...

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:07.330
Never mind... We will now assign you another special mission.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.880
Go to the Moon.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:11.090
The Moon?

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:15.880
It seems a riot has broken out at Saint Artemis' Correctional Center.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.260
Go and investigate.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.260
What about asking a local patrol to report?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:25.770
Are you saying we should let them obtain this information?

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:31.480
We'll show them the power of our Police Investigators before this gets out of hand.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.730
If it goes well...

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:36.070
A chance for us to regain our reputation.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.610
Understood.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.130
What's going on?

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.470
A riot.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.470
It seems they aren't too happy about being "corrected."

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.260
That's scary.

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:03.850
But what are we going to do?

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:07.770
If we're unable to go down from here, we won't be able to go to the location where Leopard's part is.

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.020
This might be an opportunity instead.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:14.320
We can move without being noticed if we mix together with that mob.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.650
Use the Q-Tector program.

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:19.530
Ul and I will go into stealth.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:22.740
That's awesome.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:24.080
Is this it?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.540
Suppress!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:34.710
Freedom! Freedom!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.630
Freedom!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:42.340
Looks like it went well.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:43.720
All right. Let's go.

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:51.060
Shishidou-san!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:52.520
Akiha.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.400
Don't worry about me. Go on ahead!

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.320
Ah! Ojou-sama!

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:26.870
The Moon... Sister?

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.670
Don't call me big sister at school.

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:31.340
Ah. Sorry.

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:33.130
So is Nerval involved?

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:36.400
We should be prepared for anything, so go as backup.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.930
My my...

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.430
There are still lessons in the afternoon.

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:46.180
"Please, Emilio-kun" was Shishidou Kazane's direct orders.

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:51.310
Leave this to me, Kazane-san.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:56.030
The fastest ship is waiting at the port already.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:57.170
Understood!

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:09.330
Mad Scream.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:12.840
I'm done playing with it.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:16.470
Ah! This is too boring! Too boring! Too boring!

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.720
Why is it this boring?

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:23.070
It's all their fault for leaving me to get bored here alone.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.100
Throwing me aside and going off somewhere to have fun.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.100
Unforgivable.

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:30.850
Isn't it about that time where I go and fetch them personally?

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:33.500
Why, I have such a generous heart!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:45.370
Something is in there.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:52.500
That is...

00:11:57.380 --> 00:12:00.050
Hello. Hello.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.740
Let's be friends.

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:03.850
For real?

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:07.890
Let's move on.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.960
We don't enough time to bother with such a thing.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:18.400
What?

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:25.280
Itsuki.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:26.330
That's...

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.290
Be careful.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.620
He's skilled.

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:35.710
Let's be friends.

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:39.050
Turn into fireworks, Baldie!

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:55.520
That movement just now...

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:05.780
Let's be friends. Let's be friends.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:07.580
Ul's missiles...

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.830
He altered the flight path of my rockets. What a monster.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.790
I'll seal his movements.

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:13.790
Move back.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.090
Now!

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.680
Don't think badly of me!

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:36.810
It broke free from the QT.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:41.070
That thing is equipped with modern shields.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:45.070
Let's be friends. Let's be friends.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.250
That's too bright!

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:56.580
What a thing to happen!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.460
My body is going to melt.

00:13:58.460 --> 00:14:00.590
Shade! Where is the shade?

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:06.760
My precious shell is going to melt!

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:14.060
That was close.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.440
Fine, Sun!

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:19.940
Just as you wished, I shall walk the road overshadowed.

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:21.480
But remember this...

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:24.360
Since ancient times, shiny fools

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:28.570
have paled in comparison to dark people like me.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:34.910
Why you!

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:39.580
Ul!

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:47.430
Out of bullets, Empty.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.300
Let's be friends.

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:05.320
Umm...

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:13.240
Hey.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:14.290
Let's be friends.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:15.950
It's dangerous!

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.330
Friends.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.090
I'm Go-chan.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.260
I'm Go-chan.

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.220
I'm Go-chan.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:33.350
Friends. Friends. I'm Go-chan.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.260
That...

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:37.390
We should have done that from the beginning.

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:39.980
I'm suddenly feeling much more tired now.

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:42.190
You two, come and be friends too.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:44.860
Friends. Friends.

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:50.820
If it was Akiha, she definitely would have done this.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:59.000
Friends. Friends.

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:02.080
The part for Leopard is inside?

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.130
It should be.

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:13.640
What is it? Where can it be?

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:15.430
Are you all friends?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:20.520
Eh... Friends?

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:23.900
Who are... you?

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:33.620
W-What is it?

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:39.410
For friends of Mr. Black Belt, you're really cuddly.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.540
Mr. Black Belt?

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:43.380
Really cuddly?

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:46.500
Yeah! Sakura modified it.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.670
It was thrown aside as trash but after modification it became reliable.

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:52.150
Mr. Black Belt's friends are my friends.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.550
Do you want me to order you some pork bowls?

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:01.370
As I thought, history can be repeated.

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:04.810
Next will be that little girl.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.440
Argh... That was troublesome...

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:12.450
Imo-chan, are you all right?

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:13.530
Yes.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:16.990
Ojou-sama, your hair is a mess.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:20.830
We have arrived.

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:24.330
Seems like there's something there.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:27.210
Hello. Hello.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.840
Let's be friends.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.460
That's awesome!!!

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:35.430
This model is the Earth's fourth generation self-support robot!

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:38.050
Giga-romantic.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:39.930
Imo-chan...

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:41.220
Let's be friends.

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.890
Yes! Yes!

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:44.270
Hold on... Definitely!

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:46.730
Friends. Friends.

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:48.310
I'm Go-chan.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:50.750
Let's go. Imo-chan.

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:00.910
Ojou-sama.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:03.410
I'm Go-chan.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.790
I'm Go-chan.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.080
I'm Go-chan.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:09.130
Friends. Friends.

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:11.750
I was in a bad situation.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:14.380
I expected too much...

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.220
Shiny and cuddly...

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:26.770
Shishidou-san, an acquaintance of yours?

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:29.360
Eh? She's my younger sister.

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:32.230
The youngest one... Sakura.

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:33.650
Sakura-sama.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:38.030
Imo-chan, it's been a while.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:56.550
What are you doing here?

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:00.470
Restoration work.

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:02.470
Restoration?

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:06.520
A strange uncle told me that if I repaired the structures over here,

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:08.230
he would treat me to a food buffet.

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:09.350
That's why I came.

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:11.310
Restoration?

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:12.860
Ojou-sama!

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.610
T-This is bad!

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:15.860
Take a look at this.

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:18.570
This person here... This person here is...

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:20.340
Who?

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:22.280
What's wrong?

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.740
Ojou-sama, hurry up!

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:26.750
What's this?

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.620
It seems to be broadcasting from somewhere nearby.

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:31.330
A combat freak?

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.710
Not that... The person on the left.

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:37.260
Image warping!

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.010
Eh?!

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:41.640
Onee-chan?!

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:46.220
Wah! Takane onee-chan!

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.180
It's Takane onee-chan...

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.190
It definitely is.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:52.730
Why is she in such a place?

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.320
Is that a droid?

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:57.460
No, it's armor...

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.700
The name is Aleida.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:02.740
A wanted S-class X-QT criminal.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:05.120
What is she doing at a place like this?

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.830
Onee-chan is in danger.

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:07.750
Yes.

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:11.750
Shishidou-san.

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.670
That's Takane onee-tan...

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:14.880
Let's go.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:15.670
Huh?

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:19.010
Why... At such a place...

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.650
That's definitely Takane-sama.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:29.180
This is...

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:30.410
Onee-chan...

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.350
It really is Takane onee-chan.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.070
Who are you?

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:46.530
What did you do to Onee-chan?

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.000
Those people with boxes on their heads...

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.870
I met them a long time ago.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:55.290
Who are they?

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:56.880
Nerval.

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:59.710
They are the servants of Nerval.

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.090
They are Humanity's...

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:03.970
Humanity's Enemy.

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:25.490
Honoka-chan...

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:45.180
Oh... So that's where you were, withered leaf.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:47.640
Le-Leopard?

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:53.390
I thought that you might be feeling lonely, so I came just for you.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:58.360
The time for chaos has arrived.

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:03.360
What?

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:07.240
So you've shown yourself, Leopard.

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:08.950
This voice is...

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:10.990
I have a very bad feeling about this...

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:13.470
Ner... val...

00:22:21.170 --> 00:22:26.130
Aren't you happy with our reunion, Leopard?

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:44.210
My heart is on a trip,

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:50.160
Blooming at the number of stars that no one has seen

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:55.940
With unstoppable curiosity,

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:58.460
I want to go with you,

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:01.550
in a shuttle flying through the past and future

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:06.690
Advancing forward, don't stop us.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:12.900
Trying to change tomorrow is fine, right?

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:18.430
Go on, with the excited feeling

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:24.890
you found from the answer found when you were lost.

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:30.830
Jump from Earth! Encounters are the galaxies' crossroads

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:36.700
Isn't coincidence's prank pleasant?

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:39.500
Suddenly jumping boundlessly

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:42.390
Friends of space

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:48.110
Journeys do become a habit, don't they?

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:53.740
Journeys and girls are the same...

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:55.770
Ya know!

00:24:00.060 --> 00:24:15.040
Battle of the Gods

00:24:00.900 --> 00:24:03.520
The next caller has an alias of "Sakamatsu."

00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:05.070
Leo-san and Pard-san, Good Evening.

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:06.750
It's always fun listening.

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:09.030
Um...This isn't a duet. This is solo.

00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:10.070
On to the next one...

00:24:10.070 --> 00:24:11.530
Fukuyama-san, Jun-san good evening.

00:24:11.530 --> 00:24:13.580
You two are the best!

00:24:13.580 --> 00:24:15.040
I'm telling you I'm a solo.
